4. CART decision trees (Gini impurity)
======================================
  blobs, max depth 3 (x0, x1 are the coordinates; leaves show the training counts):
    if x0 <= -0.893:
    |   if x1 <= -2.166:
    |   |   if x0 <= -2.644:
    |   |   |   => class 0  [1, 0, 0]
    |   |   else:
    |   |   |   => class 2  [0, 0, 7]
    |   else:
    |   |   if x1 <= -1.041:
    |   |   |   => class 0  [4, 0, 2]
    |   |   else:
    |   |   |   => class 0  [57, 0, 0]
    else:
    |   if x1 <= -0.361:
    |   |   if x1 <= -1.186:
    |   |   |   => class 2  [0, 0, 42]
    |   |   else:
    |   |   |   => class 1  [2, 5, 5]
    |   else:
    |   |   if x0 <= -0.317:
    |   |   |   => class 0  [1, 0, 0]
    |   |   else:
    |   |   |   => class 1  [0, 54, 0]
